  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f9d0aa6620c8c76",
      "translationZh": "为 mod 的提示词装饰新增了 virtualText：在提示词输入框中显示的文本，既不会进入草稿，也不会进入提交的提示词",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "816cbbc7fa244a7a",
      "translationZh": "为 OpenTelemetry 的 api_request 事件新增了 cache_creation_5m_tokens 和 cache_creation_1h_tokens，按存续时间区分缓存写入",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b1066d380fb6776b",
      "translationZh": "为 mod 新增了 .ui.view( agentId )：可按需在主视图中显示某个智能体的对话记录，调用 .ui.view() 则返回原视图",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bab3a56cf20e7325",
      "translationZh": "为 mod 的 Text 新增了 dir 属性，用于从右向左书写的文本：在 Windows 和 VS Code 的终端中，其文本行按该方向排列并右对齐",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3f0262c6eaffee7a",
      "translationZh": "在 Claude Platform on AWS 上新增了 /advisor；只有通过 /advisor、advisorModel 或 --advisor 选定顾问后，顾问才会运行，设置 CLAUDE_CODE_DISABLE_ADVISOR_TOOL=1 可将其关闭",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c37c5d4ec592f562",
      "translationZh": "为追踪跨度新增了 OpenTelemetry GenAI 语义约定属性，例如 gen_ai.provider.name、gen_ai.conversation.id、gen_ai.tool.name 和 error.type",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3c634d2dd1ff8cf6",
      "translationZh": "新增了在 agent.spawn mod 钩子中改写工作流智能体的提示词和模型的支持，此前该钩子只能拒绝工作流智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6a1b3aff76d67bfe",
      "translationZh": "新增了 prompt.change mod 钩子，当提示词输入框中的文本因非键入编辑而发生变化时触发，例如调出历史记录条目、清空、撤销或插件填入内容",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "7fce8e86d3ff6fc3",
      "translationZh": "修复了云会话中的一个问题：实际是会话自身的网络设置阻止了对某个主机的访问，却告知 Claude 是组织策略阻止了访问。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "184bb462e28f8f85",
      "translationZh": "修复了在选择较小的自动压缩窗口时，/autocompact 发出 token 用量过高警告的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4e5fe92c9b9e4898",
      "translationZh": "修复了在后台命令仍在运行时退出，SessionEnd 钩子有时不执行的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c43dcb21dc2adacc",
      "translationZh": "修复了 claude --help 在对 --restricted 的描述中提及已移除工具的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "11494d1868387804",
      "translationZh": "修复了 claude agents 在某个拉取请求返回的数据不完整时，不刷新任何拉取请求状态的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "467bd35d231c5957",
      "translationZh": "修复了云会话的容器被替换后，如果后台智能体此前已经恢复过一次，Claude 就会被告知该智能体已丢失、无法恢复的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d62eba643a915ddc",
      "translationZh": "修复了你曾向其输入消息的子智能体在完成任务后不久就从 /tasks 中消失，导致无法返回该对话的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2a90f42698a5747a",
      "translationZh": "修复了在查看子智能体时，已完成任务的父智能体从面包屑导航中消失、其子智能体被重新显示为顶层根节点的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "dbbfa1349790e4cd",
      "translationZh": "修复了智能体视图在输入突发到达时，将键入的单词（如 \"up\"、\"down\" 或 \"escape\"）误当成对应按键的问题；这可能导致预览窗口在回复过程中移动，或清空草稿。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "acf454c6b819a5b4",
      "translationZh": "修复了自动工具搜索（ENABLE_TOOL_SEARCH=auto）在对话中途关闭的问题，例如在恢复会话后 MCP 服务器重新连接期间。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "35a860a11405917e",
      "translationZh": "修复了登录被 forceLoginOrgUUID 拒绝后，被拒绝的组织的令牌仍被存储，或在执行 /login 后仍然有效的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4cc06df133d26570",
      "translationZh": "修复了 Claude Desktop 和 Remote Control 会话中的差异视图未能察觉 reftable 仓库中发生冲突的 cherry-pick 或 revert 操作的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2486a07f21fa98a8",
      "translationZh": "修复了在调用的输入到达期间，Artifact 工具的详细输出和 ctrl+o 输出行显示 Artifact(\"(unprintable path)\") 的问题；现在，该行会像 Bash 的对应行一样显示 \"Waiting…\" 和 \"Running…\"。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cee788091d154f67",
      "translationZh": "修复了因崩溃导致会话记录最后一行被截断时，恢复会话后写入的第一条会话记录丢失的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ae85928dc837ad95",
      "translationZh": "修复了当消息或子文件夹项目包含 Unicode 行分隔符或段落分隔符（U+2028、U+2029）时，/branch 丢弃消息以及 claude purge 跳过这些子文件夹项目的问题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
